Vnum            10312
Name            裂核底脈臺~
Description
底脈臺懸在深井最低可見處，腳下黑紅脈潮翻湧不息，彷彿還有更巨大的裂核層在更下方緩慢甦醒。
~
SectorType      SECT_INSIDE

#Exit
Direction       UP
ExitVnum        10311
ExitDesc        ~
ExitKeyword     ~
ExitKey         0
End

#Exit
Direction       DOWN
ExitVnum        10401
ExitDesc        ~
ExitKeyword     ~
ExitKey         0
End

#Enquire
Keyword         深層~
End

#Enquire
Keyword         脈潮~
End

End
